<title>NETHERLANDS: UBBINK FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT HALVED.</title>
<headline>UBBINK FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT HALVED.</headline>
<dateline>DOESBURG, Netherlands 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.5  vs   2.9</p>
<p>    Turnover			     104    vs 106</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction and garden materials group Ubbink NV</p>
<p>said in March it could not give a 1996 results forecast.</p>
<p>    Restructuring charge		 2.2  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Net loss after one-off charges   0.7  vs   2.9 profit</p>
<p>    Cash flow				2.7  vs   6.2</p>
<p>    Cash flow per share (guilders)   4.10 vs   9.57</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
